        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Magical battery-powered children's toys fill the area and begin rolling, bumping, and flipping over one another. The toys are semi-corporeal constructs that can't be moved or damaged. When you Cast the Spell and the first time you Sustain it each subsequent round, you choose the turbulence the toys create, then move the area up to 5 feet.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Ankle Bumpers</strong> The toys jostle against the feet of creatures in the area, and each creature must succeed at a Reflex save or fall @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Prone].</p></li><li><p><strong>Battery Hogs</strong> The toys steal energy to power themselves. All battery-operated devices in the area lose 2 charges.</p></li><li><p><strong>Strobe Rave</strong> The toys unleash a dizzying array of flashing lights and puffs of colored smoke. Each creature in the area must succeed at a Will save or be @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Dazzled] until the start of your next turn. This effect has the visual trait.</p>\n</li></ul>"
